    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "企業倫理與社會責任",
    "sub_ename": "BUSINESS ETHICS AND  CORPORATE SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程的目標在於介紹企業倫理與社會責任的重要性，並進一步界定經理人在這兩個領域完好的推動任務。接著兩個單元，說明倫理原則與標準及社會責任原則，隨後作一比較。\r\n\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "The objective of this course is to introduce why the business ethics and social responsibility are important today and to further the definition of the role that managers play in promoting excellence in both areas. Following two sections introduce both the ethics principles and standards and the social responsibility principles to provide a base for comparison throughout the rest of this proceedings.",
